=== common headers
header: Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
header: Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
header: Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
header: Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1
header: Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
header: Vary: Accept-Encoding
header: X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
header: X-Dns-Prefetch-Control: off
header: X-Download-Options: noopen
header: X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
header: X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none
header: X-Ratelimit-Limit: 1000
header: X-Ratelimit-Remaining: <varies>
header: X-Ratelimit-Reset: <varies>
header: X-Request-Id: <varies>
header: X-Xss-Protection: 0

=== GET /v1/containers (no token)
status: 401
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
missing or invalid API Key

=== GET /v1/containers (token: wrong-token)
status: 401
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
missing or invalid API Key

=== GET /v1/events (no token)
status: 401
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
missing or invalid API Key

=== GET /v1/events (token: wrong-token)
status: 401
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
missing or invalid API Key

=== GET /v1/history?since=yesterday
status: 400
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
invalid 'since' parameter: invalid time parameter: parsing time "yesterday" as "2006-01-02T15:04:05Z07:00": cannot parse "yesterday" as "2006"

=== GET /v1/history?until=
status: 400
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
invalid 'until' parameter: empty value

=== GET /v1/history?limit=-1
status: 400
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
invalid 'limit' parameter: limit must be non-negative

=== GET /v1/history?since=2026-10-08T00:00:00Z&until=2026-10-07T00:00:00Z
status: 400
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
invalid time range: 'since' must not be after 'until'

=== GET /v1/unknown
status: 404
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
missing header: Vary
body:
Not Found

=== POST /v1/update
status: 429
header: Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
header: Retry-After: 30
body:
{
  "api_version": "v1",
  "error": "another update is already running",
  "timestamp": "<timestamp>"
}

=== GET /readyz (no token)
status: 503
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
Service Unavailable

=== GET /v1/containers
status: 500
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
failed to list containers

=== GET /v1/containers/details
status: 500
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
failed to get container details

=== GET /v1/images
status: 500
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
failed to list images

=== POST /v1/check
status: 500
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
body:
failed to check for updates

=== POST /v1/update
status: 500
header: Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
missing header: Vary
body:
Internal Server Error
